A complete automated content workflow might look like:

```text
Content Idea
     ↓
Content Generation
     ↓
Human / Automated Review
     ↓
Platform Adaptation
     ↓
Content Storage
     ↓
Campaign Assignment
     ↓
Scheduling
     ↓
Task Queue
     ↓
Automation Worker
     ↓
Account Environment
     ↓
Platform
     ↓
Result
     ↓
Monitoring
     ↓
Analytics / Optimization
```

Each stage has a specific responsibility.

This is more maintainable than putting the entire workflow into one large automation script.

